WARNING: --apply-scope cluster is equivalent to cluster-admin. The identity can create ClusterRoles and
bindings (bind and escalate), so it can grant itself anything. It is derived from the env's render so an
unexpected kind is Forbidden, but that is a tripwire, not a boundary. Prefer --apply-scope namespace:<ns> where the env fits.

